ideo her response I think you see  it once and you hear it twice Taylor  fans quickly went to work doing what  Taylor fans do and they seem to think  the title the new album is a lover since  it shows up twice in the lyrics and you  see it in the video right there I cannot  wait for Taylor's new album I think this  is gonna be the best one yet and of  course we'll be here to talk all things  Taylor Swift with you so be sure to keep  it locked on UT until next time I'm  Haley Stephens bye for now  [Music]
 

